    "summary": "S2 durable queue is implemented. User-authorized manual self-review found and fixed a real HIGH issue: an authoritative receipt matching a conflicting retry must also match any retained identity before being returned. Regression failed before and passes now across changed payload/scope and pending/terminal frames, with no checkpoint mutation. Related11/11, package63/63 Mac and Linux,55 SIGKILL boundaries/platform, current-source proof3/3, full benchmark and root build pass. SELF-REVIEW.md records reviewed source/invariants and no remaining blocking finding identified; this is explicitly self-review, not an independent daemon CR. Formal BUILD completion remains pending the independent-review freshness gate; canonical prior CR retained. Config unchanged. S3 design may proceed against approved HLD/sc3 contract; actual store/worker/IPC remain later stories.",
